  "description": "A circumference with center O, upper-right boundary point X, radius OX labelled r, and strictly interior lower-right point M. Modern regularization, not source givens: circularize the scan, use undisplayed radius 3 as a layout scale, and regularize unmeasured positions. No numerical radius, fill, coordinate or membership answer is displayed.",
